---
import SiteIcon from './SiteIcon.astro';

const configuredEmail = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL?.trim() ?? '';
const contactEmail = /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(configuredEmail) ? configuredEmail : '';
const fallbackMailto = contactEmail
	? `mailto:${contactEmail}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('老旧默片｜网站联系')}`
	: '';
---

<aside class="contact-widget" data-contact-widget data-ready="false" aria-label="联系站主">
	<button
		class="contact-launcher"
		type="button"
		data-contact-launcher
		aria-expanded="false"
		aria-controls="contact-panel"
	>
		<SiteIcon name="letters" />
		<span>联系我</span>
	</button>

	<section
		class="contact-panel"
		id="contact-panel"
		data-contact-panel
		role="dialog"
		aria-modal="false"
		aria-labelledby="contact-panel-title"
		hidden
	>
		<header class="contact-heading">
			<div>
				<p>有重要的事想告诉我？</p>
				<h2 id="contact-panel-title">联系我</h2>
			</div>
			<button class="contact-close" type="button" data-contact-close aria-label="收起联系挂件">×</button>
		</header>

		<div class="contact-view-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="联系挂件功能">
			<button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="contact-compose-view" data-contact-view-button="compose">写留言</button>
			<button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="contact-lookup-view" data-contact-view-button="lookup">查进度</button>
		</div>

		<div id="contact-compose-view" role="tabpanel" data-contact-view="compose">
			<p class="contact-intro">先选择来信类型，我会更快找到重点。</p>
			<p class="contact-service" data-contact-service role="status">正在检查私密联系通道…</p>

			<form id="contact-form" method="post" action="/api/contact" data-contact-form autocomplete="off">
				<fieldset data-contact-fields disabled>
					<legend class="sr-only">填写联系内容</legend>
					<input class="contact-honeypot" type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />
					<input type="hidden" name="category" value="privacy" data-contact-category />
					<input type="hidden" name="page_path" data-contact-page-path />

					<div class="contact-categories" aria-label="来信类型">
						<button type="button" data-contact-category-button="privacy" aria-pressed="true">
							<SiteIcon name="rights" />
							<span><strong>隐私问题</strong><small>纠错、限制公开、撤下</small></span>
						</button>
						<button type="button" data-contact-category-button="collab" aria-pressed="false">
							<SiteIcon name="collection" />
							<span><strong>合作洽谈</strong><small>展览、研究、授权、媒体</small></span>
						</button>
						<button type="button" data-contact-category-button="other" aria-pressed="false">
							<SiteIcon name="story" />
							<span><strong>其他事宜</strong><small>建议、询问或留言</small></span>
						</button>
					</div>

					<div class="contact-context" role="status" aria-live="polite">
						<strong data-contact-context-title>隐私问题</strong>
						<span data-contact-context-copy>请指出相关档案或页面及风险；此类来信会优先进入人工核对。</span>
					</div>

					<label data-contact-reference-field>
						<span>相关档案编号或页面地址 <small>选填</small></span>
						<input name="reference" maxlength="500" placeholder="例如：LJM-… 或网页地址" />
					</label>

					<label>
						<span>怎么称呼您 <small>选填</small></span>
						<input name="name" maxlength="40" placeholder="昵称或机构简称即可" />
					</label>

					<div class="contact-row">
						<label>
							<span>回复方式</span>
							<select name="contact_type" data-contact-channel>
								<option value="email">电子邮箱</option>
								<option value="wechat">微信</option>
								<option value="phone">电话</option>
								<option value="none">无需回复</option>
							</select>
						</label>
						<label data-contact-value-field>
							<span>联系方式</span>
							<input name="contact" type="email" required minlength="3" maxlength="120" placeholder="您的邮箱" data-contact-value />
						</label>
					</div>

					<label>
						<span>简要说明</span>
						<textarea name="message" required minlength="10" maxlength="2000" rows="4" placeholder="请写清楚事情、涉及的页面和希望如何处理" data-contact-message></textarea>
						<small class="contact-count" data-contact-count>0 / 2000</small>
					</label>

					<div class="contact-privacy-note">
						<SiteIcon name="rights" />
						<p>首次留言请勿发送完整证件号、精确住址、清晰签名、医疗资料或未脱敏图片。需要补充材料时，请先确认安全的传递方式。</p>
					</div>

					<label class="contact-consent">
						<input type="checkbox" name="processing" required />
						<span>我已阅读隐私提示，同意为处理这次联系而私密保存以上内容。</span>
					</label>

					<div class="contact-actions">
						<a class="contact-detail-link" href="/corrections/" data-contact-correction-link>查看纠错与撤下说明</a>
						<button class="ui-action ui-action--primary" type="submit" data-contact-submit>提交留言</button>
					</div>
					<p class="contact-feedback" data-contact-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
				</fieldset>
			</form>

			<section class="contact-receipt" data-contact-receipt hidden tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="contact-receipt-title">
				<p>请妥善保存这份回执</p>
				<h3 id="contact-receipt-title">留言已收到。</h3>
				<dl>
					<dt>联系编号</dt><dd data-contact-receipt-id></dd>
					<dt>查询密钥</dt><dd data-contact-receipt-key></dd>
				</dl>
				<p class="contact-receipt-note">查询密钥相当于这封留言的钥匙，请勿公开分享。回执不会显示您的联系方式或留言正文。</p>
				<div class="contact-receipt-actions">
					<button class="ui-action ui-action--secondary" type="button" data-contact-copy-receipt>复制回执</button>
					<button class="ui-action ui-action--secondary" type="button" data-contact-save-receipt>保存回执</button>
					<button class="contact-detail-link" type="button" data-contact-open-lookup>查询进度</button>
				</div>
			</section>

			<noscript><p class="contact-unavailable">请在浏览器中开启 JavaScript 后使用联系挂件。页面不会在未提交时保存您填写的内容。</p></noscript>
			<div class="contact-fallback" data-contact-fallback hidden>
				<p>私密联系通道暂时不可用。隐私、纠错或撤下事项可以先查看处理说明。</p>
				<div>
					<a href="/corrections/">纠错与撤下说明</a>
					{contactEmail && <a href={fallbackMailto}>发送备用邮件</a>}
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div id="contact-lookup-view" role="tabpanel" data-contact-view="lookup" hidden>
			<div class="contact-lookup-heading">
				<h3>查询联系进度</h3>
				<p>输入回执上的联系编号和查询密钥。结果只显示处理状态和站主给您的说明。</p>
			</div>
			<form method="post" action="/api/contact/lookup" data-contact-lookup-form autocomplete="off">
				<label>
					<span>联系编号</span>
					<input name="id" required pattern="LX-[A-Fa-f0-9]{24}" placeholder="LX-…" spellcheck="false" data-contact-lookup-id />
				</label>
				<label>
					<span>查询密钥</span>
					<input name="key" type="password" required pattern="[a-f0-9]{64}" autocomplete="off" data-contact-lookup-key />
				</label>
				<button class="ui-action ui-action--secondary" type="submit">查询进度</button>
			</form>
			<p class="contact-lookup-result" data-contact-lookup-result role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
		</div>
	</section>
</aside>

<script>
	import '../scripts/contact-widget';
</script>

<style>
	.contact-widget {
		position: fixed;
		right: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right));
		bottom: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
		z-index: 70;
		font-family: "Songti SC", "STSong", "SimSun", serif;
	}

	.contact-launcher {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		min-width: 7rem;
		min-height: 2.75rem;
		padding: 0.58rem 0.8rem;
		color: #fff8ed;
		background: var(--site-accent);
		border: 1px solid var(--site-accent);
		box-shadow: 0 7px 22px rgba(48, 45, 39, 0.2);
		cursor: pointer;
		font: inherit;
		font-size: var(--site-text-small);
		letter-spacing: 0.09em;
	}

	.contact-launcher:hover,
	.contact-launcher:focus-visible {
		background: #7f3427;
		border-color: #7f3427;
	}

	.contact-launcher .site-icon {
		width: 1rem;
		height: 1rem;
	}

	.contact-panel {
		position: absolute;
		right: 0;
		bottom: 3.45rem;
		width: min(25rem, calc(100vw - 32px));
		max-height: calc(100vh - 6.5rem);
		max-height: calc(100svh - 6.5rem);
		padding: 1.25rem;
		overflow-y: auto;
		color: #302f2b;
		background: #f7f2e6;
		border: 1px solid #9f978a;
		box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(59, 48, 34, 0.22);
	}

	.contact-heading {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.contact-heading p,
	.contact-heading h2,
	.contact-intro,
	.contact-service,
	.contact-feedback,
	.contact-lookup-result {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.contact-heading p {
		color: var(--site-accent);
		font-size: var(--site-text-micro);
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
	}

	.contact-heading h2 {
		margin-top: 0.2rem;
		font-size: 1.45rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
	}

	.contact-close {
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		width: 2.5rem;
		height: 2.5rem;
		padding: 0;
		color: #5f594f;
		background: transparent;
		border: 0;
		cursor: pointer;
		font: 1.35rem/1 system-ui, sans-serif;
	}

	.contact-view-tabs {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.2rem;
		margin-top: 0.8rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #c5bcad;
	}

	.contact-view-tabs button {
		min-height: 2.45rem;
		padding: 0.35rem 0;
		color: #70685c;
		background: transparent;
		border: 0;
		border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
		cursor: pointer;
		font: inherit;
		font-size: var(--site-text-small);
	}

	.contact-view-tabs button[aria-selected='true'] {
		color: var(--site-accent);
		border-bottom-color: var(--site-accent);
	}

	.contact-intro,
	.contact-service,
	.contact-unavailable,
	.contact-fallback p,
	.contact-lookup-heading p {
		color: #6c6458;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}

	.contact-intro {
		margin-top: 0.85rem;
	}

	.contact-service {
		min-height: 1.3rem;
		margin-top: 0.35rem;
	}

	.contact-service[data-unavailable] {
		color: #8a3d2f;
	}

	#contact-form fieldset {
		min-width: 0;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		border: 0;
	}

	.contact-honeypot {
		position: absolute;
		left: -10000px;
		width: 1px !important;
		height: 1px;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.contact-categories {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 0.4rem;
		margin-top: 0.65rem;
	}

	.contact-categories button {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0.38rem;
		min-width: 0;
		min-height: 4.15rem;
		padding: 0.55rem 0.45rem;
		color: #514d45;
		text-align: left;
		background: rgba(255, 253, 247, 0.3);
		border: 1px solid #b9b0a2;
		cursor: pointer;
		font: inherit;
	}

	.contact-categories button[aria-pressed='true'] {
		color: #7f3427;
		background: var(--site-accent-soft);
		border-color: var(--site-accent);
	}

	.contact-categories .site-icon {
		width: 0.95rem;
		height: 0.95rem;
		margin-top: 0.05rem;
	}

	.contact-categories span,
	.contact-categories strong,
	.contact-categories small {
		display: block;
		min-width: 0;
	}

	.contact-categories strong {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	.contact-categories small {
		margin-top: 0.15rem;
		color: #776f63;
		font-size: 0.66rem;
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	.contact-context {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.2rem;
		margin-top: 0.65rem;
		padding: 0.62rem 0.7rem;
		background: rgba(154, 63, 46, 0.07);
		border-left: 2px solid var(--site-accent);
	}

	.contact-context strong {
		font-size: 0.76rem;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.contact-context span {
		color: #6a6154;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	#contact-form label,
	[data-contact-lookup-form] label {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.3rem;
		margin-top: 0.7rem;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	#contact-form label > span small {
		margin-left: 0.3rem;
		color: #82796c;
		font-size: 0.67rem;
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	#contact-form input:not([type='checkbox']),
	#contact-form select,
	#contact-form textarea,
	[data-contact-lookup-form] input {
		width: 100%;
		min-width: 0;
		min-height: 2.45rem;
		padding: 0.55rem 0.62rem;
		color: #3b362f;
		background: rgba(255, 253, 247, 0.56);
		border: 1px solid #b8ae9d;
		border-radius: 2px;
		font: 0.76rem/1.65 system-ui, "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
	}

	#contact-form textarea {
		resize: vertical;
	}

	.contact-count {
		justify-self: end;
		color: #7b7265;
		font: 0.67rem/1.4 system-ui, "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
	}

	.contact-row {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 7.3rem minmax(0, 1fr);
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.contact-privacy-note {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0.45rem;
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
		color: #655d51;
	}

	.contact-privacy-note .site-icon {
		flex: 0 0 auto;
		width: 0.95rem;
		height: 0.95rem;
		margin-top: 0.16rem;
		color: var(--site-accent);
	}

	.contact-privacy-note p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.69rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	#contact-form .contact-consent {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0.45rem;
		color: #625a4f;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.contact-consent input {
		flex: 0 0 auto;
		width: 1rem;
		height: 1rem;
		margin: 0.13rem 0 0;
		accent-color: var(--site-accent);
	}

	.contact-actions,
	.contact-receipt-actions,
	.contact-fallback > div {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: flex-end;
		gap: 0.55rem;
		margin-top: 0.8rem;
	}

	.contact-actions .ui-action,
	.contact-receipt-actions .ui-action {
		min-height: 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 2px;
	}

	.contact-detail-link,
	.contact-fallback a {
		color: var(--site-accent);
		font: inherit;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
	}

	button.contact-detail-link {
		padding: 0;
		background: transparent;
		border: 0;
		cursor: pointer;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.contact-feedback,
	.contact-lookup-result {
		min-height: 1.2rem;
		margin-top: 0.45rem;
		color: #8a3d2f;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
		white-space: pre-wrap;
	}

	.contact-receipt {
		margin-top: 0.8rem;
		padding: 0.85rem;
		background: #eceddf;
		border: 1px solid #81917b;
	}

	.contact-receipt > p:first-child {
		margin: 0;
		color: #65715f;
		font-size: 0.69rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
	}

	.contact-receipt h3 {
		margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.contact-receipt dl {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 4.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
		gap: 0.45rem;
		margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.contact-receipt dd {
		margin: 0;
		overflow-wrap: anywhere;
		font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace;
	}

	.contact-receipt-note {
		margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
		color: #62695d;
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	.contact-fallback {
		margin-top: 0.7rem;
		padding: 0.7rem;
		background: #eee0ce;
		border-left: 2px solid var(--site-accent);
	}

	.contact-fallback p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.contact-fallback > div {
		justify-content: flex-start;
		margin-top: 0.35rem;
	}

	.contact-lookup-heading {
		margin-top: 0.9rem;
	}

	.contact-lookup-heading h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.contact-lookup-heading p {
		margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
	}

	[data-contact-lookup-form] button {
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
	}

	.sr-only {
		position: absolute;
		width: 1px;
		height: 1px;
		padding: 0;
		margin: -1px;
		overflow: hidden;
		clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
		white-space: nowrap;
		border: 0;
	}

	.contact-widget [hidden] {
		display: none !important;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.contact-widget {
			right: max(10px, env(safe-area-inset-right));
			bottom: max(10px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
		}

		.contact-panel {
			bottom: 3.15rem;
			width: calc(100vw - 20px);
			max-height: calc(100svh - 4.75rem);
			padding: 1rem;
		}

		.contact-launcher {
			min-height: 2.5rem;
		}

		#contact-form input:not([type='checkbox']),
		#contact-form select,
		#contact-form textarea,
		[data-contact-lookup-form] input {
			font-size: 1rem;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 370px) {
		.contact-categories .site-icon {
			display: none;
		}

		.contact-categories button {
			padding-inline: 0.35rem;
		}

		.contact-row {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	@media print {
		.contact-widget {
			display: none;
		}
	}
</style>
